eského Těšína i z Cieszyna.</p>"}, {"_id": "49bbdb7", "tab_title": "Budu si moci web upravovat sám?", "tab_content": "<p>Ano. Stavíme na WordPressu a Elementoru – texty, fotky i nové stránky si upravíte sami a ukážeme vám, jak na to.</p>"}], "_css_classes": "ww-faq"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}, {"id": "5f0982f", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-light", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "poptavka"}, "elements": [{"id": "1024783", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "e3ce0e2", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-head ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "5673ab3", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "6801b38", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Poptávka", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-eyebrow"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "504b4f7", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Nový web pro vaši firmu z Českého Těšína?", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "8fed1f8", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Tvorba webových stránek Český Těšín začíná jednou zprávou. Napište pár vět nebo rovnou zavolejte – ozvu se obvykle do jednoho pracovního dne.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-muted ww-lead"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "f45cd9e", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-contact", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "d1233cf", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "se